  "definition": "Calculation of Particulate Matter Emission Standards",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-07-22",
  "historyNote": "#8215, eff 11-24-04 (from Env-A 2103); ss by #10314, eff 4-23-13; ss by #13693, eff 7-22-23",
